{"id":"7d3975b6f5ca63e6","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-np-verifier-characterization.md","title":"NP Verifier Characterization","display":"thm-np-verifier-characterization — NP Verifier Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-np-verifier-characterization","aliases":["28-thm-np-verifier-characterization","NP Verifier Characterization"],"display":"thm-np-verifier-characterization — NP Verifier Characterization","depends_on":["[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-np-verifier-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-np-verifier-characterization</span><span>NP Verifier Characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-np-verifier-characterization — NP Verifier Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77951782409bcade\" href=\"?note=77951782409bcade\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier\">28-df-polynomial-time-verifier</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77951782409bcade\" href=\"?note=77951782409bcade\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier\">28-df-polynomial-time-verifier</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定机器每步只有有限多个选择，接受分支可由多项式长度二进制选择串编码，确定型验证器按该串模拟。反向先猜测受长度界限制的证据，再运行确定型验证器；所有分支在多项式时间内停机。证据长度“恰为”或“至多”可通过长度字段与填充互换。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.6及证明；印刷41–42页；PDF67–68页。两个方向已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier","status":"resolved","id":"77951782409bcade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 与 $\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier","status":"resolved","id":"77951782409bcade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 与 $\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{NP}_{\\mathrm{ver}}.","display":true}],"bytes":1096,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anch